{
  "name": "rich-text-spans",
  "description": "RichText whose root span is bold #1E88E5 'Hello ' with two children: an italic #43A047 'world' span that nests an underlined #E53935 span whose text is a page-state Value, and an unstyled span whose text is V.static('!'). textAlign center, maxLines 1 and overflow ellipsis sit on the RichText itself. The server resolves the static span to the plain string '!', keeps the state span's Value, and the node watches `name` from a Value two spans deep; every client resolver fills the inner span with the page state ('Ada') and passes the rest through unchanged.",
